libsmb2 7.0.0 (SMB2/3 client, compiled from vendored sources)
  Copyright (C) Ronnie Sahlberg and contributors
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1
  https://github.com/sahlberg/libsmb2

  Vendored at ios/Runner/libsmb2/: unmodified copies of upstream lib/,
  libdcerpc/ and the public headers, plus include/apple/config.h as config.h.
  DreamPlayer compiles them per build with ios/libsmb2_build.sh into an arm64
  static archive and links libsmb2.a. The only file we add is shim/ios_shim.c,
  which supplies getlogin_r() because iOS has none and libsmb2's own fallback
  in compat.c only compiles on the console platforms it was written for.

  Statically linked, so LGPL 2.1 section 6 is satisfied by this project being
  GPLv3 (a Combined Work): the complete corresponding source is this repository
  plus the unmodified upstream sources under ios/Runner/libsmb2/. Section 6 also
  allows compliance for a statically linked library by conveying the Minimal
  Corresponding Source plus the object files needed to relink against a modified
  library; the sources are present and CI rebuilds the archive from them.

